{
  "title": "Wall heating: numerical overheating in Noh flow and at reflecting walls",
  "html": "<h1>Wall heating: numerical overheating in Noh flow and at reflecting walls</h1><p>Wall heating is a localized numerical excess of specific internal energy, often accompanied by a density depression, when a strong shock forms at a reflecting wall or a convergence center. This is distinct from physical heating supplied through a wall. Existing Noh calculations illustrate how to inspect the error.</p><h2 id=\"reference\">Fix the exact post-shock state first</h2><p>Use the cold ideal-gas Noh problem with gamma=5/3, initial density 1 and inward velocity −1. Here d=1 is planar, d=2 cylindrical-radial and d=3 spherical-radial. The formulas describe the uniform post-shock state r&lt;r_s. Shock-cut cells require matching exact conserved cell means rather than point values.</p><p>Specific internal energy e is per unit mass; script E is total energy per unit volume and m is momentum density. The value e(U) formed from cell-mean conserved variables generally differs from the exact cell mean of e. Retain the quantity defined in each saved figure.</p><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>u</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma=5/3,\\quad \\rho_0=1,\\quad u_0=-1,\\quad p_0=0:\\quad r_s=t/3,\\quad(\\rho,p,u)_2=(4^d,4^d/3,0),\\quad e_2=1/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5/3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" styl